  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Similarly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>therefore we can say that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;are in A.P.</p></blockquote>",
